#: rc.cpp:16
msgid "Use smooth scaling (high quality but slower)"
msgstr "Gebruik glad skalering (hoog kwaliteit maar stadiger)"

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid "Keep aspect ratio"
msgstr "Hou aspek verhouding"

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid ""
"If this is checked KView will always try to keep the aspect ratio. That "
"means if the width is scaled with a factor x, the height is scaled with the "
"same factor."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie is nagegaan K-bekyk sal altyd probeer na hou die aspek "
"verhouding. Wat beteken As die wydte is skaleer met 'n faktor x, die hoogte "
"is skaleer met die selfde faktor."

#: rc.cpp:19
msgid "Center image"
msgstr "Sentrum beeld"

#: rc.cpp:20
msgid "Minimum height:"
msgstr "Minimum hoogte:"

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid ""
"The height of the image shown will not get smaller than the size you enter "
"here.\n"
"A value of 10 would make a 1x1 image be stretched vertically by a factor of "
"10."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:22
msgid "Maximum height:"
msgstr "Maksimum hoogte:"

#: rc.cpp:23
msgid ""
"The height of the image shown will not get bigger than the size you enter "
"here.\n"
"A value of 100 would make a 1000x1000 image be compressed vertically by a "
"factor of 0.1."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:24
msgid "Minimum width:"
msgstr "Minimum wydte:"

#: rc.cpp:25
msgid ""
"The width of the image shown will not get smaller than the size you enter "
"here.\n"
"A value of 10 would make a 1x1 image be stretched horizontally by a factor "
"of 10."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:26
msgid "Maximum width:"
msgstr "Maksimum wydte:"

#: rc.cpp:27
msgid ""
"The width of the image shown will not get bigger than the size you enter "
"here.\n"
"A value of 100 would make a 1000x1000 image be compressed horizontally by a "
"factor of 0.1."
msgstr ""

